The MIT terms above cover the work original to this repository: the pack
scripts, make_pck.mjs, and the warring_lords, shiny_orbits and hello_godot
examples.

Two examples are vendored from upstream projects and keep their own terms.
Everything here is freely redistributable, but one asset set carries an
attribution requirement, so it is spelled out rather than folded into the MIT
grant above.

